00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,400
Slide 4. System Architecture. The bot is built from two python scripts.

2
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:10,960
Token scanner.py connects to the pump portal web socket and listens for brand new token launches.

3
00:00:10,960 --> 00:00:15,360
When it detects one, it waits 25 seconds for DexScreener to index the pair,

4
00:00:15,360 --> 00:00:20,320
then runs it through rug detection, safety filters and scoring. If the token passes,

5
00:00:20,320 --> 00:00:26,800
it hands it to bot.py, which buys it via Jupyter's Swap API, monitors the price every

6
00:00:26,800 --> 00:00:33,040
8 seconds using DexScreener and sells when it hits 2x or stops out at 18% loss.

7
00:00:33,040 --> 00:00:39,360
After a win, 60% gets reinvested and 40% is saved. That's the full loop.

8
00:00:39,360 --> 00:00:40,000
